<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Your Nest Shop verification code</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f7f6f2;color:#242b25;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;">
    <div style="display:none;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;">Your one-time code to continue with Nest Shop.</div>
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#f7f6f2" style="background-color:#f7f6f2;">
        <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding:32px 16px;">
                <!-- A fluid table and inline styles keep the email independent of shop assets. -->
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:560px;">
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding:0 0 24px;">
                            <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                                <tr>
                                    <td width="40" height="40" align="center" bgcolor="#526b44" style="width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:10px;background-color:#526b44;color:#ffffff;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:40px;">N</td>
                                    <td style="padding-left:12px;color:#242b25;font-size:24px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:-1px;">Nest Shop<span style="color:#526b44;">.</span></td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td bgcolor="#ffffff" style="padding:32px 24px;border:1px solid #dddcd4;border-top:4px solid #526b44;border-radius:10px;background-color:#ffffff;">
                            <p style="margin:0 0 12px;color:#526b44;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;">Your Nest Shop account</p>
                            <h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;color:#242b25;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:32px;font-weight:normal;line-height:40px;">Your verification code</h1>
                            <p style="margin:0 0 24px;color:#62695f;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;">Enter this one-time code on the page where you requested it to continue with your account.</p>
                            <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                                <tr>
                                    <td align="center" bgcolor="#e7eadf" style="padding:22px 12px;border:1px solid #d6decd;border-radius:8px;background-color:#e7eadf;">
                                        <p style="margin:0 0 8px;color:#3b5330;font-size:11px;line-height:16px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;">Verification code</p>
                                        <p style="margin:0;color:#242b25;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;font-size:36px;line-height:44px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:6px;">{{code}}</p>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                            <p style="margin:24px 0 0;color:#62695f;font-size:14px;line-height:23px;">Use this code before it expires, and keep it private. Never share your verification code with anyone.</p>
                            <p style="margin:20px 0 0;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #eee;color:#62695f;font-size:14px;line-height:23px;">Didn't request this code? You can safely ignore this email.</p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px 0;color:#62695f;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;">Nest Shop &middot; Your account, your discoveries.<br>This is an automated verification email.</td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>
